message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
title: claude-devtools-lite
abstract: >-
  A local, read-only dashboard for inspecting Claude Code sessions: timelines,
  thinking blocks, tool calls, diffs, token usage, subagents and memory, with an
  embedded terminal, a file explorer and a visual output pane. Zero
  dependencies; runs on macOS, Linux and Windows.
type: software
authors:
